    "detailed_description": "This game is a pop-cute shooting game!<br />\r\nThe objective of the game is to defeat the stage bosses and win all the stages!<br />\r\nTo defeat the bosses, you need bullets and bombs to damage them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 3 types of bullets you can use!<br />\r\n\u3010NormalBullets\u3011<br />\r\nWhen you shoot it, it will go straight ahead! It has the most firepower of all bullets!<br />\r\nRaising the level will not only increase the firepower, but also shorten the firing interval!<br />\r\n\u3010TrackingBullet\u3011<br />\r\nWhen shot at an enemy, it will track towards that enemy! The firepower is a little low!<br />\r\nRaising the level will not only increase the firepower, but also the tracking performance!<br />\r\n\u3010ReflectiveBullet\u3011<br />\r\nWhen they hit a non-enemy target, they bounce back! The firing interval is long!<br />\r\nRaising the level not only increases the firepower, but also the number of times they ricochet!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can equip one of three types of bullets!<br />\r\nThe bosses in each stage have different weapons.<br />\r\nEach boss has its own unique moves!<br />\r\nSo use different bullets for different stages!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd those who have cleared all the stages<br />\r\nYou can also play &quot;Endless Mode&quot; where you just keep on surviving!<br />\r\nLet's aim for the height of POPTANK!",
    "about_the_game": "This game is a pop-cute shooting game!<br />\r\nThe objective of the game is to defeat the stage bosses and win all the stages!<br />\r\nTo defeat the bosses, you need bullets and bombs to damage them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 3 types of bullets you can use!<br />\r\n\u3010NormalBullets\u3011<br />\r\nWhen you shoot it, it will go straight ahead! It has the most firepower of all bullets!<br />\r\nRaising the level will not only increase the firepower, but also shorten the firing interval!<br />\r\n\u3010TrackingBullet\u3011<br />\r\nWhen shot at an enemy, it will track towards that enemy! The firepower is a little low!<br />\r\nRaising the level will not only increase the firepower, but also the tracking performance!<br />\r\n\u3010ReflectiveBullet\u3011<br />\r\nWhen they hit a non-enemy target, they bounce back! The firing interval is long!<br />\r\nRaising the level not only increases the firepower, but also the number of times they ricochet!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can equip one of three types of bullets!<br />\r\nThe bosses in each stage have different weapons.<br />\r\nEach boss has its own unique moves!<br />\r\nSo use different bullets for different stages!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd those who have cleared all the stages<br />\r\nYou can also play &quot;Endless Mode&quot; where you just keep on surviving!<br />\r\nLet's aim for the height of POPTANK!",
